  (text "HAPTICS: DRV2605L drives an 8 mm LRA from the switched rail +3V3_HAPT.\nR4 holds EN low while the MCU is in reset. Pin 6 (VDD/NC) left open - CHECK datasheet.\nC2/C3 values (1 uF) are defaults - CHECK datasheet."
