  (text "BUTTONS: active low. Pull-up, series resistor, RC debounce and ESD clamp per button.\nThe MCU reads BTN_CONFIRM_N directly in the secure world; it is the only signing approval input.\nBTN_POWER_RAW also goes to the charger push-button input (power sheet, not drawn yet).\nSwitch and TVS part numbers TBD (candidates: Panasonic EVQ-P7 side-push; 0402 ESD diode)."
    (at 170 20 0)
    (effects
